# Game-day script rerun on the fixed build (acknowledgement after a majority).
# (The replicate step runs only where the background replicator would have caught up.)
ack majority
telemetry 1
telemetry 2
write wp1 north-gate
write wp2 orchard
replicate
telemetry 3
telemetry 5
write wp3 landing-pad
crash 0
failover
read wp3
write wp4 home
check
crash 1
failover
write wp5 field-edge
read wp4
check
